            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "It is most certainly due to using not using a release version of Neovim 0.10.0. Probably a Nightly build of 0.10 prior to [this commit](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/commit/141182d6c6c06ad56413b81a518ba9b777a0cbe0).\r\n\r\nOnly using released version of Neovim or *latest* Nightly is supported.",
